--- cuckoo_filter
String = FixedString	2	2
FixedString(3) = String	1	1
FixedString(3) = wider	0	0
has LC	1	1
hasAny LC	1	1
hasAll LC	1	1
has FS3	1	1
hasAny FS3	1	1
has FS3 wider	0	0
mapContainsKey LC	1	1
mapContains LC	1	1
mapContainsValue LC	1	1
IN with empty array	2	2
IN without empty array	2	2
